{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#0f1720;--card:#0b1220;--accent:#7dd3fc;--muted:#94a3b8;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);--cta:#60a5fa}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;line-height:1.45;color:#e6eef6;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#071022 120%);min-height:100vh}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 28px}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#4ade80);display:grid;place-items:center;color:#07203a;font-weight:700}
    nav{display:flex;gap:12px}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px}
    nav a:hover{color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .primary-cta{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--cta),#3b82f6);color:#07203a;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none}

    /* Hero */
    .hero{padding:34px 28px 18px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:start}
    .hero-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:26px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(2,6,23,0.6)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:24px;color:#e8f5ff}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px}

    /* Pattern panel */
    .pattern-wrap{height:220px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;position:relative;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#061426 0%, #051321 100%);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
    .pattern-svg{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0.12}
    .contact-panel{padding:18px}

    /* Form */
    form{display:grid;gap:12px}
    input,textarea,select{background:var(--glass);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:#dcefff}
    input::placeholder,textarea::placeholder{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35)}
    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .row > *{flex:1}
    button[type=submit]{background:var(--cta);border:none;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;color:#07203a;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}

    /* Mixer */
    .mixer{margin-top:14px;padding:16px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.01),transparent);border-radius:10px}
    .mixer .options{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .mixer button{flex:1;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid transparent;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}
    .mixer button.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0ea5e933,#60a5fa22);border-color:rgba(96,165,250,0.18);color:#eaf6ff}

    /* Recommendations */
    .reco{margin-top:12px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(10,20,32,0.45);color:#dbefff}
    .reco h3{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:16px}
    .reco ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Proof gallery */
    .proof{padding:22px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.01),transparent)}
    .testi{min-height:78px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
    .quote{font-size:15px;color:#e9f6ff;margin:0}
    .author{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}
    .badges{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}
    .badge{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;color:var(--muted);position:relative}
    .badge[data-tip]:hover::after{content:attr(data-tip);position:absolute;bottom:calc(100% + 10px);left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#062134;color:#e6f7ff;padding:8px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(2,6,23,0.6)}

    /* Footer */
    footer{padding:18px 28px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    @media(max-width:920px){
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .pattern-wrap{height:140px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">SB</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700;color:#e8f5ff">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="/index.html">Gatherings</a>
      <a href="/events.html">Calendar</a>
      <a href="/private-sessions.html">Private</a>
      <a href="/pricing.html">Rates</a>
      <a href="/about.html">The Method</a>
      <a href="/faq.html">Practical Qs</a>
      <a href="/book.html">Reserve</a>
      <a href="/contact.html" style="color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px">Connect</a>
    </nav>
    <a class="primary-cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-card">
        <h1>Contact & Intention</h1>
        <p class="lead">Ask about upcoming community sessions, private sessions, or how to adapt a practice for medical needs. We keep replies succinct and practical.</p>

        <div style="margin-top:16px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px">
          <div style="background:var(--glass);padding:10px;border-radius:8px;color:#dff6ff">
            <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">Next public session</div>
            <div style="font-weight:700">Fri · 7:00–8:15pm</div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
          </div>
          <div style="background:var(--glass);padding:10px;border-radius:8px;color:#dff6ff">
            <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">Phone</div>
            <div style="font-weight:700">{{PHONE}}</div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Email: {{EMAIL}}</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mixer" aria-label="Sound preference mixer">
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px">Sound intensity preference</div>
          <div class="options">
            <button type="button" class="mix-btn" data-level="gentle">Gentle</button>
            <button type="button" class="mix-btn active" data-level="medium">Medium</button>
            <button type="button" class="mix-btn" data-level="intense">Intense</button>
          </div>
          <div class="reco" id="recommendations">
            <h3>Suggested path</h3>
            <ul id="reco-list">
              <li>Short guided session + crystal bowls — smooth transition to rest.</li>
              <li>Group session recommended for first-timers (30–60 min).</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:14px;display:flex;gap:10px">
          <a class="primary-cta" href="/book.html">Reserve a space</a>
          <a href="/events.html" style="padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none">View calendar</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="hero-card contact-panel">
        <div class="pattern-wrap">
          <!-- Decorative inline SVG pattern unique to this page -->
          <svg class="pattern-svg" viewBox="0 0 600 220" preserveAspectRatio="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1">
                <stop offset="0" stop-color="#064e67"/>
                <stop offset="1" stop-color="#032031"/>
              </linearGradient>
              <pattern id="p1" x="0" y="0" width="40" height="40" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                <rect width="40" height="40" fill="url(#g1)" />
                <path d="M0 30 L10 20 L20 30 L30 20 L40 30" stroke="#06324a" stroke-width="1" fill="none" opacity="0.6"/>
                <circle cx="6" cy="6" r="1.8" fill="#0ea5e9" opacity="0.14"/>
              </pattern>
            </defs>
            <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#p1)" />
            <g fill="#0ea5e9" opacity="0.06">
              <circle cx="80" cy="40" r="70" />
              <circle cx="380" cy="160" r="90" />
            </g>
          </svg>
          <div style="position:relative;z-index:2;color:#dff6ff;text-align:center;width:100%">
            <div style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700">Let's talk</div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Questions, booking, accessibility requests</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <form id="contact-form" aria-label="Contact form" style="margin-top:12px">
          <div class="row">
            <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your name" required />
            <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email address" required />
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <input type="tel" name="phone" placeholder="Phone (optional)" />
            <select name="how" aria-label="I am enquiring about">
              <option value="event">Upcoming event</option>
              <option value="private">Private session</option>
              <option value="access">Accessibility / contra</option>
              <option value="other">Other</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <textarea name="message" rows="4" placeholder="Tell us briefly how we can help..." required></textarea>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between">
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Preferred intensity is synced to the mixer above.</div>
            <button type="submit">Send message</button>
          </div>
        </form>

        <div style="margin-top:12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">
          Or call: <strong style="color:#e8f5ff">{{PHONE}}</strong> · Email: <strong style="color:#e8f5ff">{{EMAIL}}</strong>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section style="padding:0 28px 22px">
      <div class="proof">
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#e8f5ff">Proof & credentials</div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Short rotation of participant notes and the certificates that matter.</div>
          </div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Auto-rotate · Hover badges for more</div>
        </div>

        <div style="display:flex;gap:20px;margin-top:12px;align-items:flex-start">
          <div style="flex:1">
            <div class="testi" id="testimonial">
              <p class="quote" id="quote">"I arrived restless and left with a surprisingly calm body — the room felt tuned to steady breath."</p>
              <div class="author" id="author">— Alex, member</div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:10px">
              <button id="prev" aria-label="Previous testimonial">◀</button>
              <button id="pause" aria-label="Pause rotation">⏸</button>
              <button id="next" aria-label="Next testimonial">▶</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="width:220px">
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Recognitions</div>
            <div class="badges">
              <div class="badge" data-tip="Completed 200+ guided sessions locally">Community Verified</div>
              <div class="badge" data-tip="Trauma-aware facilitation training">Trauma-aware</div>
              <div class="badge" data-tip="Local wellness board listing">City Wellness Listing</div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">Press and local listings are available on the About page.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="padding:0 28px 60px">
      <div class="hero-card" style="border-radius:12px;padding:18px">
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#e8f5ff">Health & contraindications — please read</h3>
        <p style="margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">Sound sessions are generally gentle but are not suitable for everyone. If you have any of the following, please consult your healthcare provider and reach out before booking:</p>
        <ul style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">
          <li>Active pregnancy (consultation required for positioning)</li>
          <li>Recent surgery or severe musculoskeletal injuries</li>
          <li>Uncontrolled epilepsy or photosensitive conditions</li>
          <li>Severe psychiatric conditions that might be triggered by altered states</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">If in doubt, use the contact form or call to clarify — we will help make a safe plan or suggest alternatives.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px">
      <div>© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} · Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      <div style="color:var(--muted)">Reach: {{PHONE}} · {{EMAIL}}</div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Populate year
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Mixer logic
    const buttons = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.mix-btn'));
    const recoList = document.getElementById('reco-list');
    const profiles = {
      gentle: [
        '30–45 min: Guided breath + soft crystal bowls',
        'Ideal for first-timers and sensitive nervous systems',
        'Seated options available'
      ],
      medium: [
        '60 min: Layered bowls with vocal harmonics',
        'Balanced dynamic—enter with light intention',
        'Good for weekly rhythm and sleep support'
      ],
      intense: [
        '75–90 min: Deeper bass and sustained overtones',
        'For experienced participants seeking somatic release',
        'Beginners should consult before booking'
      ]
    };

    function setActive(level){
      buttons.forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active', b.dataset.level===level));
      updateRecommendations(level);
    }

    function updateRecommendations(level){
      const items = profiles[level] || profiles.medium;
      recoList.innerHTML = items.map(i=>'<li>'+i+'</li>').join('');
      // sync a hidden input or something if needed — for demo we set a dataset
      document.querySelector('form')?.setAttribute('data-preferred-level', level);
    }

    buttons.forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click', ()=>setActive(b.dataset.level)));
    // default
    setActive('medium');

    // Contact form submission (mock)
    const form = document.getElementById('contact-form');
    form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const formData = new FormData(form);
      const payload = Object.fromEntries(formData.entries());
      payload.preferred_level = form.getAttribute('data-preferred-level') || 'medium';
      // Simple feedback UI
      const btn = form.querySelector('button[type=submit]');
      btn.disabled = true; btn.textContent = 'Sending...';
      setTimeout(()=>{
        btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = 'Send message';
        alert('Message queued. We will reply within 48 hours.');
        form.reset();
      }, 900);
    });

    // Proof gallery rotation
    const testimonials = [
      {quote:'A steady, unhurried practice — I sleep more deeply after a session.', author:'— Morgan, attendee'},
      {quote:'Soft textures, clear guidance. I left with less tension in my shoulders.', author:'— Priya, teacher'},
      {quote:'They held space with care; I found words I did not have before.', author:'— Daniel, artist'}
    ];
    let tIndex = 0;
    let rotating = true;
    const quoteEl = document.getElementById('quote');
    const authorEl = document.getElementById('author');

    function showTesti(i){
      const t = testimonials[i % testimonials.length];
      quoteEl.textContent = '"' + t.quote + '"';
      authorEl.textContent = t.author;
    }

    function nextTesti(){ tIndex = (tIndex+1) % testimonials.length; showTesti(tIndex); }
    function prevTesti(){ tIndex = (tIndex-1+testimonials.length) % testimonials.length; showTesti(tIndex); }

    document.getElementById('next').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ nextTesti(); rotating=false; });
    document.getElementById('prev').addEventListener('click', ()=>{ prevTesti(); rotating=false; });
    const pauseBtn = document.getElementById('pause');
    pauseBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ rotating = !rotating; pauseBtn.textContent = rotating ? '⏸' : '▶'; });

    showTesti(0);
    setInterval(()=>{ if(rotating) nextTesti(); }, 4200);

    // small accessibility: keyboard shortcuts for mixer (1/2/3)
    window.addEventListener('keydown', (e)=>{
      if(e.key==='1') setActive('gentle');
      if(e.key==='2') setActive('medium');
      if(e.key==='3') setActive('intense');
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and developer notes for the sound bath events site (chunk 4).

Files included in this chunk:
- contact.html — the full contact page with interactive features.

Purpose:
- Provide a clear contact surface for prospective attendees and clients.
- Offer a local JS 'sound preference mixer' that updates program recommendations in real time.
- Include a rotating "Proof Gallery" (testimonials) with credibility badges that reveal details on hover.
- Surface a responsible contraindications section and encourage pre-booking consultation where needed.

Key features and how to test them locally:
1) Sound preference mixer
   - Visible on the contact page as three buttons: Gentle, Medium, Intense.
   - Click a button to change the recommended program list; the contact form stores the selected level in a data attribute.
   - Keyboard shortcuts: press 1 for Gentle, 2 for Medium, 3 for Intense.

2) Proof Gallery rotation
   - Auto-rotates testimonials every ~4.2 seconds.
   - Controls let you navigate: previous, pause/play, next. Clicking any control pauses automatic rotation (except play).
   - Badges to the right show additional details via CSS tooltips on hover.

3) Contact form (mocked)
   - Form validates required fields; on submit, it simulates sending and shows a simple alert after a short delay.
   - The payload (mocked) includes the selected sound intensity.

Accessibility & practical notes:
- The layout uses semantic form controls and aria-labels for key regions.
- Colors are chosen for contrast on a dark background; tweak CSS variables in the <head> for brand adjustments.

Placeholders in the template (must be replaced by your templating/server engine):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Design & differences to past templates:
- Navigation labels are intentionally different: Gatherings, Calendar, Private, Rates, The Method, Practical Qs, Reserve, Connect.
- CTA phrasing and program language differ from previous versions; recommendations use distinct program names and durations.
- The page includes a custom inline SVG pattern (unique visual identity) rather than external image assets.

Notes for integration:
- This chunk intentionally includes only contact.html for this pass. The rest of the site pages are referenced by link paths and should exist in the same directory when assembling the full site.
- There is no external dependency; all JS and CSS are local and inlined.

Contraindications and safety:
- The contact page includes a short, responsible list of contraindications and advises contacting the team or a provider if unsure. Keep this copy accurate to your organization's policies.

Developer seed/metadata (for records):
- Slug: sound_bath-MORE-2026-02-17T12-48-36-005Z-048
- Seed: 182486170
- Layout family: clinic_modern
- Voice family: practical_guide
- Offer model: events_series
- Section pack: hero,gallery,what_to_expect,objections,cta

If you need additional pages (index, events, private-sessions, pricing, about, faq, book) or the SVG asset at assets/img/pattern.svg created separately, request the next chunk and specify any branding refinements."}
